# {{ team }}: API tests

Made with `qa-agent init`: a working project on {{ "pytest" if framework == "pytest" else "REST Assured and TestNG" }},
against the reference API to start with. It has one starter case (TC001), approved so the project
runs on day one: replace it with your own.

## Run it

```bash
pip install "api-qa-agent @ git+https://github.com/rahulsharma-qe/api-qa-agent.git"   # qa-agent, env_check, the reference API
{% if framework == "pytest" %}
pip install -r requirements.txt            # the framework
{% else %}
# once, in a clone of api-qa-agent, until the framework is published:
#   cd frameworks/restassured_api && ./mvnw -q install -DskipTests
{% endif %}
python -m demo_api &                       # the reference API (your environment replaces it)
python -m env_check --env demo             # is the environment ready?
{{ "pytest --junitxml=reports/junit.xml" if framework == "pytest" else "./mvnw test" }}
qa-agent trace --results {{ "reports/junit.xml" if framework == "pytest" else "target/surefire-reports" }}
```

## Bring your own

```bash
qa-agent import api api/source/openapi.json          # or a .curl file with a sample response
qa-agent import cases existing/api_cases_template.xlsx   # or your Excel, CSV, Postman or .feature files
qa-agent check                                       # what to fix before review
qa-agent review export                               # review/cases.xlsx: approve, send back, reject
qa-agent review apply
qa-agent generate                                    # approved cases -> {{ "tests/generated" if framework == "pytest" else "src/test/java/generated" }}
```

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `qa-agent.yaml` | The team, its main service, its framework |
| `api/api.yaml` | The API model |
| `acceptance-criteria.yaml` | The acceptance criteria |
| `cases/` | The cases, one file per feature |
| `existing/api_cases_template.xlsx` | An empty sheet in the API layout, to write cases in Excel |
| `config/` | Environments and what the tests depend on |
| `{{ "tests/generated/" if framework == "pytest" else "src/test/java/generated/" }}` | The generated tests: never edited by hand |
| `.github/workflows/api-tests.yml` | CI: environment ready, generated tests up to date, tests, trace |
